WEBVTT

00:01:56.680 --> 00:01:57.439
Young Master Pan

00:01:59.719 --> 00:02:01.640
Isn't this Carpenter Li who went missing not long ago?

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:02.519
What's wrong with him?

00:02:03.840 --> 00:02:04.719
He's been poisoned.

00:02:05.319 --> 00:02:06.560
Second Master Luo, what are you doing here?

00:02:08.039 --> 00:02:09.520
I heard you entered the Miasma Forest.

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:10.319
I was very worried.

00:02:10.479 --> 00:02:11.280
So I came to check on you.

00:02:13.879 --> 00:02:14.680
Here, let me take him.

00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:16.520
A ghost!

00:02:17.479 --> 00:02:20.039
Miss Lin, a ghost!

00:02:21.680 --> 00:02:22.319
Young Master Pan.

00:02:22.319 --> 00:02:23.360
Do you have any more Antidote Pills?

00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:25.879
Could you give me some more later?

00:02:26.280 --> 00:02:27.560
You still plan to go to that Miasma Forest?

00:02:28.599 --> 00:02:30.240
When we wait for Carpenter Li to wake up,

00:02:30.439 --> 00:02:32.000
we'll know the whole story.

00:02:32.560 --> 00:02:33.639
There's no need for you to take that risk again.

00:02:54.479 --> 00:02:56.319
The person I saw in my dream was you.

00:02:57.319 --> 00:02:59.400
The one I want to marry is also you.

00:03:00.319 --> 00:03:01.159
It is now,
Support Admin Watch on
kissasia.cam or kisskh.org

00:03:02.159 --> 00:03:03.080
and it will be in the future.

00:03:09.479 --> 00:03:11.360
I never thought about marrying and having children before.

00:03:11.719 --> 00:03:12.719
Not until I met you.

00:03:13.439 --> 00:03:14.719
Only then did I feel that the days to come

00:03:16.439 --> 00:03:18.280
could take on other, more hopeful shapes.

00:03:21.039 --> 00:03:21.639
A Lan.

00:03:23.240 --> 00:03:25.360
Would you be willing to grow old together with me?

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:33.759
Miss A Lan.

00:03:33.879 --> 00:03:34.560
You were looking for me?

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:35.919
Yes.

00:03:35.919 --> 00:03:37.199
I'd like you to help me inquire

00:03:37.199 --> 00:03:39.080
if anyone has heard of the Celestial Frostbloom.

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:40.120
If there's any lead,

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:40.759
I will reward you handsomely.

00:03:41.319 --> 00:03:41.759
Alright.

00:03:49.479 --> 00:03:51.280
I thought you'd forgotten your mission.

00:03:52.439 --> 00:03:53.719
Didn't you say the Celestial Frostbloom

00:03:53.719 --> 00:03:54.719
wouldn't die for a while?

00:03:54.919 --> 00:03:55.520
What's the rush?

00:03:56.159 --> 00:03:57.840
But you haven't even found it yet.

00:03:58.759 --> 00:04:00.199
You drew it looking like this monstrosity.

00:04:00.479 --> 00:04:01.360
How am I supposed to find it?

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:13.719
The Celestial Frostbloom

00:04:13.719 --> 00:04:14.680
just looks like this monstrosity.

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:18.839
Why is A Lan looking for that Celestial Frostbloom?

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:22.560
I'll tell you all later.

00:04:22.800 --> 00:04:23.199
By the way,

00:04:23.199 --> 00:04:24.399
Has Carpenter Li not woken up yet?

00:04:24.800 --> 00:04:26.319
Young Master Pan has already given him medicine.

00:04:26.879 --> 00:04:27.759
Whether he can wake up

00:04:27.959 --> 00:04:28.759
depends on the next few days.

00:04:29.600 --> 00:04:30.240
However,

00:04:30.680 --> 00:04:31.519
even if he wakes up,

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:33.360
I'm afraid he won't live for many more days.

00:04:34.519 --> 00:04:36.360
Young Master Pan has not yet found

00:04:36.360 --> 00:04:38.040
a method to cure the Five-Fold Poison Herb's toxin.

00:04:42.399 --> 00:04:43.439
You all go and investigate carefully

00:04:43.439 --> 00:04:44.199
Miss Lin's death.

00:04:44.639 --> 00:04:45.759
See if there's anything suspicious.

00:04:48.879 --> 00:04:49.680
I'm going out for a bit.

00:04:49.879 --> 00:04:51.040
You all stay at the Benevolent Peace Hall for now.

00:04:51.399 --> 00:04:51.839
Eldest Cousin.

00:04:52.079 --> 00:04:52.920
Let me go with you.

00:04:53.240 --> 00:04:53.720
No need.

00:04:53.839 --> 00:04:54.480
I'll be back soon.

00:05:06.600 --> 00:05:07.439
Miss A Lan.

00:05:07.759 --> 00:05:08.759
These books here

00:05:08.759 --> 00:05:10.040
record all sorts of medicinal herbs

00:05:10.399 --> 00:05:12.079
and myths related to the herbs.

00:05:12.680 --> 00:05:14.120
Some I haven't even read myself.

00:05:14.680 --> 00:05:16.000
See if you can find the one you're looking for,

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:16.759
