00:07:15.439 --> 00:07:16.720
Hurry up and think of a way to save it!

00:07:19.439 --> 00:07:20.160
Tell me honestly.

00:07:20.839 --> 00:07:21.759
Can this Celestial Frostbloom

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:23.519
cure the Five-Fold Poison Herb's toxin?

00:07:25.120 --> 00:07:26.040
Why think so much?

00:07:26.120 --> 00:07:28.040
The urgent task is to revive the herb.

00:07:29.839 --> 00:07:31.120
Water it or fertilize it?

00:07:32.360 --> 00:07:34.040
If it were that simple, would you need to save it?

00:07:36.120 --> 00:07:37.360
I know it's not that simple.

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:38.519
So I've figured it out.

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:41.079
Rather than trying aimlessly like this,

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:42.680
I might as well give up completely.

00:07:43.279 --> 00:07:44.120
If I can't save it, so be it.

00:07:44.519 --> 00:07:45.639
At worst, I'll just stay here.

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:47.879
After all, who knows if the real world

00:07:47.879 --> 00:07:49.279
isn't just some storybook novel?

00:07:49.800 --> 00:07:50.439
Here,

00:07:50.680 --> 00:07:53.160
I am, after all, the dignified Fifth Princess.

00:07:53.720 --> 00:07:54.199
You...

00:07:57.839 --> 00:07:58.519
Fine.

00:07:59.120 --> 00:07:59.879
You win.

00:08:00.920 --> 00:08:02.399
But I can only give you one hint.

00:08:03.360 --> 00:08:04.519
Far away on the horizon,

00:08:04.720 --> 00:08:06.079
yet right before your eyes.

00:08:14.199 --> 00:08:16.600
Folk Records of the Strange.

00:08:24.360 --> 00:08:25.279
Why did you call me here?

00:08:25.920 --> 00:08:26.480
I still have to go with A Zi

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:28.000
to investigate Miss Lin's death.

00:08:28.519 --> 00:08:31.439
I want to ask for your help saving this flower.

00:08:33.519 --> 00:08:34.399
Why should I help you?

00:08:35.279 --> 00:08:36.240
Have you forgotten

00:08:36.679 --> 00:08:37.879
