00:08:51.039 --> 00:08:52.759
There are indeed a few entries inside

00:08:52.759 --> 00:08:54.000
related to medicinal herbs.

00:08:54.480 --> 00:08:55.159
Among them,

00:08:55.159 --> 00:08:57.799
the stories about herbs gaining sentience are the most plausible.

00:08:57.919 --> 00:08:59.559
Herbs gaining sentience is plausible?

