This lousy book actually has a second volume?

00:12:40.519 --> 00:12:41.480
I never expected Tianyin City

00:12:41.480 --> 00:12:42.480
to actually have the Five-Fold Poison Herb.

00:12:42.840 --> 00:12:44.200
I've only ever seen it in books before.

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:48.960
Miss A Lan.

00:12:52.559 --> 00:12:53.200
Young Master Pan.

00:12:53.600 --> 00:12:54.960
Your apprentice said that...

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:56.080
said that, um...

00:12:56.080 --> 00:12:57.320
the second volume of *Folk Records of the Strange*

00:12:57.320 --> 00:12:58.399
is in this storage room.

00:12:58.600 --> 00:12:59.039
So I...

00:12:59.039 --> 00:12:59.919
came to look for it,

00:12:59.919 --> 00:13:01.159
to see if I can find

00:13:01.360 --> 00:13:02.840
the method to save the Celestial Frostbloom.

00:13:04.440 --> 00:13:05.519
Look, I found it.

00:13:06.799 --> 00:13:08.080
Well, Young Master Pan, you carry on with your work.

00:13:08.159 --> 00:13:08.879
I'll head out first.

00:13:26.159 --> 00:13:27.440
Have you seen Young Master Yuwen?

00:13:27.879 --> 00:13:28.559
No.

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:30.840
Miss A Lan.

00:13:33.960 --> 00:13:34.679
Wait a moment, please.

