00:13:50.240 --> 00:13:51.320
If you see him later,

00:13:51.320 --> 00:13:52.200
please pass on the message for me.

00:13:52.399 --> 00:13:53.200
Of course, Miss A Lan.

00:13:54.519 --> 00:13:55.440
I'm going outside the city to gather herbs.

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:56.840
Remember to give Carpenter Li his medicine.

00:13:57.279 --> 00:13:57.759
Yes.

