Then I'll be on my way too.

00:14:04.799 --> 00:14:06.000
Miss A Lan, you may not know,

00:14:06.639 --> 00:14:09.080
but the Five-Fold Poison Herb stains very easily.

00:14:18.399 --> 00:14:18.960
You...

00:15:16.320 --> 00:15:16.840
Eldest Cousin.

00:15:17.480 --> 00:15:18.600
A Zi and I investigated.

