The only ones who saw Miss Lin drown

00:15:20.799 --> 00:15:22.720
were Second Master Luo and two other townsfolk.

00:15:23.200 --> 00:15:24.240
Her funeral

00:15:24.399 --> 00:15:25.600
was also arranged by those three.

