It's been two days already.

00:15:36.840 --> 00:15:38.080
I'm afraid it will be difficult for him to wake up.

00:15:39.480 --> 00:15:40.080
And A Lan?

00:15:40.440 --> 00:15:42.039
Is she still reading that *Folk Records of the Strange*?

00:15:42.519 --> 00:15:44.440
Miss A Lan isn't at the Benevolent Peace Hall right now.

00:15:44.639 --> 00:15:45.759
She probably went out.

00:15:46.879 --> 00:15:47.639
Oh, right, Young Master.

00:15:48.000 --> 00:15:49.000
Miss A Lan told me

00:15:49.000 --> 00:15:50.039
that if I saw you,

00:15:50.039 --> 00:15:50.840
I should pass on a message for her.

00:15:51.360 --> 00:15:53.639
She wants you to help her find a guqin.

00:15:54.559 --> 00:15:55.879
With her level of skill,

00:15:55.879 --> 00:15:56.919
she'd just be ruining a good instrument.

