How exactly did she say it to you?

00:15:59.399 --> 00:16:00.480
Tell me word for word.

00:16:05.399 --> 00:16:06.879
There's no use struggling, Miss A Lan.

00:16:07.759 --> 00:16:08.799
You won't break free

00:16:08.960 --> 00:16:10.159
