You said Young Master Pan was there too?

00:16:25.600 --> 00:16:26.320
My young master

00:16:26.320 --> 00:16:27.679
was preparing to gather herbs outside the city at the time.

00:16:29.679 --> 00:16:31.240
Young Master, I'll attend to my duties now.

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:37.000
She wouldn't say

00:16:37.000 --> 00:16:38.159
she's skilled at the guqin for no reason.

00:16:41.159 --> 00:16:42.240
Pan Yu is suspicious.

00:16:42.960 --> 00:16:43.879
He took A Lan away.

00:16:44.320 --> 00:16:45.759
Where would he take her?

00:16:46.720 --> 00:16:48.759
Carpenter Li was found in the Miasma Forest.

00:16:49.919 --> 00:16:50.639
The Miasma Forest...

00:17:02.840 --> 00:17:03.720
Miss Lin...

00:17:06.759 --> 00:17:08.160
There's no need to be surprised, Miss A Lan.

00:17:08.960 --> 00:17:09.960
Nowadays, in Tianyin City,

00:17:09.960 --> 00:17:11.279
everyone is living well.

00:17:12.319 --> 00:17:14.559
Siqing naturally couldn't die before them.

00:17:25.400 --> 00:17:27.200
